Billy, Educator: For months, my dishwasher has been malfunctioning in a
specific way. The bottom rack would come out squeaky clean, but the top
rack would come out dirty. I disassembled and replaced the filter, but no
dice. I had a plumber come 3 times, no dice. We replaced the dishwasher
with a new model, no dice.
Finally, last week I got so frustrated that I pulled out my phone and
started ranting to GPT-Live. It asked me a few diagnostic questions, then
told me it must be that there=E2=80=99s a kink in a hose under my sink. I o=
pened
the cabinet, and in the back corner there was a hose that was kinked like
a garden hose. So I fixed it, and it immediately solved the problem that 3
plumber visits couldn=E2=80=99t fix. =F0=9F=98=82
Rowan, CEO: On social media, Instagram followers that never engage drag
down your overall viewership, so I set out to remove them. But no tool can
legitimately find them, since Instagram=E2=80=99s API doesn=E2=80=99t expos=
e engagement
data.
