=F0=9F=A4=9D Community AI workflows
Every newsletter, we showcase how a reader is using AI to work smarter,
save time, or make life easier.
Today=E2=80=99s workflow comes from reader Lynn in Baton Rouge, Louisiana:
=E2=80=9CI recently lost a lot of weight, which means replacing a large por=
tion of
my clothing. I read about the =E2=80=98capsule wardrobe=E2=80=99 and knew t=
hat, as a
grandma, I needed to keep my purchases to a minimum. I looked on the web
and found lots of =E2=80=98use this=E2=80=99 ideas. None seemed to break it=
 down quite far
enough for me to turn it into a shopping list.
I asked ChatGPT to show me one. Then a picture popped up. Exactly what I
needed to get started! Then I asked it to show me how to mix-and-match
pieces, and it went right to work. After weeks of scrolling and being
confused, I finally had a visual answer to my questions. Next, I was able
to inventory what pieces I already had, such as blazers and tops, and get
a clear view of the holes in my closet.
I even topped it off with links to the perfect accessories to make new
outfits stunning. I can=E2=80=99t wait to go shopping.=E2=80=9D
